That's the advantage.

502
00:43:16,960 --> 00:43:18,380
You can buy wine.

503
00:43:18,640 --> 00:43:19,340
Pounds a bottle.

504
00:43:20,300 --> 00:43:22,160
People will go from the UK

505
00:43:22,161 --> 00:43:23,860
across to France

506
00:43:23,861 --> 00:43:26,540
for a night out and then come back.

507
00:43:26,541 --> 00:43:28,540
I mean, that is just extraordinary.

508
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:29,980
It wouldn't have happened, you know,

509
00:43:30,200 --> 00:43:32,360
it couldn't have happened 20 years ago.

510
